{"id":"615026","name":"韭菜海肠水饺","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/615026/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"海肠","amount":"几根"},{"name":"猪肉糜","amount":"60g"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"120g"},{"name":"饺子皮","amount":"几个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"半匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"原浆海肠。","img":"images/615026/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放水化冻。","img":"images/615026/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"处理干净。","img":"images/615026/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冷水浸泡过的就是挂浆了，这要是冷冻起来，就会比图一个头大很多。","img":"images/615026/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取几根，剪成小段。这个东西特别滑，用剪刀剪更顺手。","img":"images/615026/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉糜切块。","img":"images/615026/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放容器内。","img":"images/615026/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"化冻。","img":"images/615026/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放海肠。","img":"images/615026/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放食用油，食盐和鸡精及生抽，拌匀。","img":"images/615026/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"韭菜洗净。","img":"images/615026/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/615026/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"菜末放荤料里。","img":"images/615026/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/615026/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"去饺子皮。","img":"images/615026/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包饺子。","img":"images/615026/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/615026/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"锅烧开水。","img":"images/615026/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"下饺子，有个让我弄了口子，挣了。","img":"images/615026/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"把饺子煮熟。","img":"images/615026/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/615026/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/615026/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"火候要比煮别的饺子轻一些，要不海肠就老了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}